---
import RolePage from '../../components/pages/RolePage.astro';
---

<RolePage
  lang="en"
  title="For secretaries — Rondo"
  description="Rondo for club secretaries: member changes, VOG status, teams and communication in one flow."
  kicker="For your role"
  roleTitle="Secretary"
  intro="Work from one current member system. Rondo helps with member changes, VOG status, teams and committees without manual retyping, while data ownership stays with the club."
  demoLabel="Look at the demo"
  contactLabel="Contact us"
  contactHref="/en/contact/"
  screenshotSrc="/screenshot-leden-lijst.webp"
  screenshotAlt="Member list in Rondo Club"
  screenshotWidth={1920}
  screenshotHeight={1080}
  whatHeading="What this solves"
  bulletPoints={[
    'New members, address changes and cancellations flow automatically from Sportlink.',
    'Members and parents activate securely by email through the login form. When a family shares an email address, they first choose the right person; wherever possible, Rondo links a parent or guardian directly to their own profile. They can log in with a one-time email link or a password they set themselves.',
    'After logging in, users can optionally add the club version to a suitable device through Install app. Rondo does not show an automatic installation pop-up.',
    'VOG status and reminders are centralized, including follow-up.',
    'Teams, committees and roles stay organized without scattered spreadsheets.',
    'In My details, members edit their own email addresses, phone numbers and their household address. A new email address is applied only after verification.',
    'Parents can edit only the email addresses and phone numbers of their own children under 18; another parent or guardian remains read-only.',
    'Allowed changes are returned to Sportlink in a controlled flow. Processing can take up to half an hour; the change log keeps each change for 24 months and shows whether it is waiting, synchronized, Rondo-only or needs action.',
    'Available membership passes are ready to add directly to Apple Wallet or Google Wallet from My details. Members can also upload their VOG or IVA certificate there.',
    'Companies and external contact people get a proper place in your records too.',
    'Your data stays with the club and can be handed over cleanly during board transitions.',
  ]}
  cards={[
    { title: 'Data flow under control', text: 'Rondo Sync reduces duplicate work and lowers error risk between systems.' },
    { title: 'Compliance without hassle', text: 'You immediately see who has a valid VOG, what is expiring, and what needs follow-up.' },
    { title: 'Clean handover and ownership', text: 'During board transitions, context stays in the system and data control remains with the club.' },
  ]}
  otherHeading="Other paths"
  otherPrefix="Also relevant:"
  otherAnd="and"
  otherLinks={[
    { href: '/en/for-member-administration/', label: 'For member administration' },
    { href: '/en/for-gate-volunteer/', label: 'For access & events' },
  ]}
/>
